  "docs_notes": [
    "Stage 6a2 adds row and selected CASE/COALESCE/NULLIF composition. COALESCE with a required fallback removes nullability; NULLIF and ElseNull add one nullable layer, with explicit nullable variants preserving one layer.",
    "Case/ValueCase require an explicit Else/ElseNull; selected CASE accepts HavingPredicate. Grouped is an explicit phase lift and does not bypass SQL grouping validation. Group keys/query HAVING remain in 6a3.",
    "11 catalogue rows ported; three extra phase negatives. Existing compiler AST and capability families reused. New footprint row/selected probes: 1681/1511 functions with ceilings 1934/1738; existing ceilings unchanged. PostgreSQL sources compiled/vetted, lead runs them.",
    "Review SSOT correction: conditional argument-shape validation and diagnostics now have one querycore owner, shared by construction and compiler traversal; behavior unchanged."
  ],
  "vcs": "Only the explicitly requested git apply -3 --binary wrote Git state. Five conflicted index entries remain for the lead, with resolved working files. No other Git writes or commit.",
  "review_fixes": [
    {
      "finding": "Medium: conditional shape validation duplicated between ormcore construction and querycore traversal",
      "status": "fixed",
      "implementation": "querycore.ValidateConditionalArguments owns kind, zero/max argument count, NULLIF arity and the original fault.Invalid diagnostic. ormcore.Conditional calls it before allocation; compiler VisitComputedValue preserves Err precedence and delegates shape validation to the same function.",
      "changed_files": [
        "internal/querycore/conditional_expression.go",
        "internal/querycore/computed_expression.go",
        "internal/ormcore/conditional.go"
      ],
      "old_api_tests": "Unmodified. Existing conditional, phase/bounds, parameter and empty-membership tests rerun successfully."
    }
  ],
